    ```
    This should output `wayland`.
4.  Verify your applications (Neovim, VS Code, Brave, Bitwarden) and tools (curl, git, etc.) are installed and available.

You now have a NixOS system managed with Flakes and Home Manager, running GNOME on Wayland with your specified applications and tools. You can continue customizing by editing the `.nix` files and running `sudo nixos-rebuild switch --flake .#your_hostname` again.

