2.  Calculate `max_allowed_dist = (T.width - S.width) / 2.0`.
3.  Calculate `d_start = dist(S.start, segment(T.start, T.end))`.
4.  Calculate `d_end = dist(S.end, segment(T.start, T.end))`.
